---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>

<html lang="en">

<head>
  <BaseHead
    title="Journey"
    description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}
  />
</head>

<body>

  <Header />

  <main>

    <img
      src="/freedom.png"
      alt="Carmela"
      class="photo"
    />

    <p class="intro">
      Finding a Place to Call Home
    </p>

    <p>
After only a month, I am ready to call Malta home. Being retired gives me the most precious gift of all: time. Every morning I wake up and remind myself, "I am the luckiest person I know." I am incredibly excited to begin this new chapter, completely open to suggestions, to learning and discovery.
    </p>

    <p>
Initially I wanted to join an eco-village. Since none exist here on Malta, I began searching for an alternative style of living, where neighbors become an extended family, sharing life rather than just living side by side. But I realized I have to narrow down search parameters and focus on a clear path. Here's the criteria I’ve shared with real estate agents:
    </p>

    <p>
I am currently traveling and will return to Malta on 17 November, which is when I plan to begin viewings. I’m a single female looking for a modern, clean, and well-maintained apartment (ideally 2 bedrooms, though I am open to alternatives) with a budget of approximately €1,200/month.
    </p>

    <p>
I am focusing my search on walkable, vibrant neighborhoods that offer a blend of daily convenience and local charm. My preferred areas are Sliema, Balluta, Qui-Si-Sana, Tigné, Ta’ Xbiex, Gżira, and nearby.
    </p>

    <p>
Main requirements:
-Modern and well-maintained
-Fully furnished
-Air conditioning
-Elevator
-Convenient waste disposal
-Walkable area 
-Basic groceries within walking distance
-Balcony or terrace preferred
-Greenery, trees or parks nearby would be a plus
    </p>

    <p>
If you know of a neighborhood worth exploring, a property owner renting a place that fits this description, or simply a corner of these islands I shouldn't miss, I would love to hear from you. Please spread the word!
    </p>

    <img
      src="/signatureNEW.png"
      alt="Carmela's signature"
      class="signature"
    />

    <p class="email">
      <a href="mailto:contact@ourmalta.org">
        contact@ourmalta.org
      </a>
    </p>

  </main>

</body>

<style>

main {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
}

p {
  color: #1F3A5F;
  font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
}

.photo {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 420px;
  height: auto;
  margin: 0 auto 2rem;
}

.intro {
  color: #1F3A5F;
  font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.6;
  text-align: center;
  margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
}

.signature {
  display: block;
  width: 225px;
  max-width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  margin-top: 1.1rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  margin-left: 0;
}

.email {
  margin: 0;
  color: #1F3A5F;
  font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.email a {
  color: #1F3A5F;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.email a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}

</style>

</html>
